  "details": "Many avatars have displaced viewport (mostly) on z-axis. Some little, some so much that you can put your controller on your back and in vr the hand still will be in the front of the avatar. I guess that it can be because of some updates for older avatars.\n\n \n\nIt causes some issues in interacting with people (especially friends) and making poses and expressions. It would be loss to abandon well made avatars due to this as author may be unable or unwilling to tune this and every one can have different sense of correct position.\n\nIt would be nice to have it next to size setting or so instead a global setting",
